## ✅ **Matters Quality Criteria (Healthcare Edition)**

| ✔ Attribute         | ✅ What It Means                                                               |
| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Behavioral**      | Describes a direct patient or caregiver action (e.g., collect, book, consult) |
| **Specific**        | Anchored to 1–2 steps, not generalized “hospital issues”                      |
| **Customer-Led**    | Reflects frustration, relief, or confusion **in care delivery terms**         |
| **Execution-Ready** | Clinicians, Admin, or Ops teams can act on it directly                        |

