## ❌ **Avoid These MATTERS Errors (Healthcare Edition)**

| 🚫 Bad Example              | ⚠ Why It Fails                  | ✅ Healthcare Fix Example                                             |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `test result issue`         | Too vague – what was the issue? | `blood test results not uploaded to portal before follow-up`         |
| `appointment problem`       | Ambiguous – not actionable      | `double booking caused 2-hour delay in specialist consultation`      |
| `bad experience with staff` | Not specific enough             | `receptionist misplaced patient records causing repeat form filling` |
| `good service`              | Too generic                     | `nurse stayed past shift to ensure post-op pain was managed`         |

