## 🧬 **NON-NEGOTIABLE SEMANTIC LAWS**

| Principle                           | Enforcement Rule                                                                |
| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 🎯 **Experience Driver Centrality** | OU must be centered on a single, clear **Experience Driver** — no blends        |
| 🗣️ **Patient Voice First**         | `MATTERS` must reflect only **observable behavior** — never summaries or themes |
| 🔍 **Behavioral Precision**         | OU is an **atomic unit of action** — must be tightly scoped and executable      |
| 📍 **Temporal Anchoring**           | Must include all three: **Journey**, **Stage**, and **Interaction Moment**      |
| 🔒 **Single-Stream Discipline**     | Each OU maps to **one and only one** Opportunity Stream — no hybrids            |
| 🧼 **Semantic Hygiene**             | Eliminate vagueness: ❌ “bad care”, ❌ “good service”, ❌ “issue” — be behavioral  |

